    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong><i>Slumhack</i></strong> is a puzzle-platformer game featuring\u00a0<strong>indirect character control</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Play as Neriko, a girl living in a near-future slum with a virtual friend, and hack your way through the streets of Cynorm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709760/extras/1a26b90c78751d1ab5a0090899a50247.avif?t=1740432899\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make smart use of a variety of Action Buttons and guide Neriko to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709760/extras/48a7a2172917b1470313a194d0b1f437.poster.avif?t=1740432899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709760/extras/48a7a2172917b1470313a194d0b1f437.webm?t=1740432899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709760/extras/48a7a2172917b1470313a194d0b1f437.mp4?t=1740432899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709760/extras/a2070cb66eb62951895ca8770d9bb22e.poster.avif?t=1740432899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709760/extras/a2070cb66eb62951895ca8770d9bb22e.webm?t=1740432899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709760/extras/a2070cb66eb62951895ca8770d9bb22e.mp4?t=1740432899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features*</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 Hand-crafted Levels to Hack Through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Stages with Distinct Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Tiny Story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> * WIP data that is subject to change before release. </p>",
